	by imap.localhost with ESMTP id AAA001
	for <alice@localhost>; Tue, 3 Feb 2026 09:14:02 +0000
Date: Tue, 3 Feb 2026 09:14:02 +0000
From: Tess Tuesday <tess@localhost>
To: Alice Loopback <alice@localhost>
Subject: Plain text, nothing clever
Message-ID: <plain-0001@localhost>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit

This message is as simple as mail gets: one part, us-ascii, 7bit.
If a parser cannot read this, nothing else in the corpus matters.
`,
